  <div>
    
  <div>
    <a name="helptest"/>
    <h1>Help With The Next FreeBSD Release</h1>

    <p>Our developers and release engineers are working on the
      next release of FreeBSD; if you wish to help with
      testing, please download the latest build.  Please
      note that these images are, by their very nature, intended for
      testing and should not be used in production environments.</p>
  </div>

    <p>Available installation images are listed on the <a href="./where.html#helptest">download page</a>.</p>
  </div>

    

    <h1>Schedule</h1>

    <table class="tblbasic">
      <tr class="heading">
	<td>Action</td>
	<td>Expected</td>
	<td>Actual</td>
	<td>Description</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
	<td>Initial release schedule announcement</td>
	<td>-</td>
	<td>3 January 2020</td>
	<td>Release Engineers send announcement email to developers
